{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/f6dee0912f40dcd71bba6d5042631963.poster.avif?t=1769538391\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/f6dee0912f40dcd71bba6d5042631963.webm?t=1769538391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/f6dee0912f40dcd71bba6d5042631963.mp4?t=1769538391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Greetings Scratcher!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for spending your Government Granted Business Bond on franchising a <strong>Scratch n' Gas</strong>! You'll find that running a business under <strong>SCRATCH CO.</strong> is very rewarding. From selling our tickets to customers or winning on them yourself, your profit is our <i>interest</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/948e0392c214f5287029089cf0dc9a56.poster.avif?t=1769538391\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/948e0392c214f5287029089cf0dc9a56.webm?t=1769538391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/948e0392c214f5287029089cf0dc9a56.mp4?t=1769538391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scratch your way through this <strong>deck-building roguelite</strong>, where you will run your gas station and play gauntlets of scratch tickets to try to get a higher scores. The quicker you earn winnings, the more credits you have to buy <strong>Lucky Charms</strong> that help improve your run, as well as different <strong>Scratch Tickets</strong>, and <strong>Stickers</strong> that upgrade tickets they are placed on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Big Bux</strong> earned every run can be spent on unlocking <strong>upgrades</strong> for scratching or the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/5e4a8c351eb93c2825cb475d189741a5.poster.avif?t=1769538391\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/5e4a8c351eb93c2825cb475d189741a5.webm?t=1769538391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/extras/5e4a8c351eb93c2825cb475d189741a5.mp4?t=1769538391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911600?t=1769538391","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911600?t=1769538391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/47a942071a902f4d956795257939064f20c250c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769538391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911600/47a942071a902f4d956795257939064f20c250c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769538391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l